### 1.2 Target Code Inspection
Direct inspection of `/home/prem/webos-projects/cinejoy-webos/app/js/app.js`:
- **Initialization Idempotency**:
  Lines 28-32:
  ```javascript
  init: function () {
    if (this.state.initialized) {
      return;
    }
    this.state.initialized = true;
  ```
- **Async Focus Timer & Ghost Focus Prevention**:
  Lines 208-216:
  ```javascript
  if (this._focusTimer) {
    clearTimeout(this._focusTimer);
    this._focusTimer = null;
  }
  var self = this;
  this._focusTimer = setTimeout(function () {
    self._focusTimer = null;
